#: preferences.py:171
msgid "Enable/Disable QCD System.\nThe Quick Content Display system allows you to specify collections as QCD \"slots\" up to a maximum of 20. You can then interact with them through numerical hotkeys, a popup move widget, and a 3D Viewport header widget"
