#: preferences.py:192
msgid "Enable/Disable the 3D Viewport header widget.  This widget graphically represents the 20 QCD slots and allows you to interact with them through the GUI"
msgstr "启用/禁用 3D 视图标题栏控件。该控件以图形方式表示 20 个 QCD 槽位，并允许你通过图形界面操作它们"

